# InEngine PHP package standards

- Use PHP `^8.5`.
- Follow PSR standards and Laravel/PHP community style guides for code structure and conventions.
- Use Laravel Pint for formatting PHP changes.
- Test every code change with Pest (run the smallest relevant test scope first, then broader suite when needed).
- Keep package `composer.json` constraints aligned with host apps (e.g. LTC) when package compatibility allows it.
